OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and often wet day
OL,6,Fahead with some outbreaks of heavier
OL,7,Frain possible throughout the day. Low
OL,8,Fcloud with fog likely over higher
OL,9,Fground. Light southeasterly winds but
OL,10,Ffeeling rather chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud and rain gradually
OL,13,Fclearingthrough the evening, leaving
OL,14,Fdrier conditions with clear spells for
OL,15,Fa time, before further cloud and rain
OL,16,Fmoves in from the southwest for some
OL,17,Fby dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
