OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWet and rather windy
OL,6,Fthrough much of Wednesday with rain
OL,7,Fgradually clearing to the northeast
OL,8,Fleaving some drier periods to end the
OL,9,Fday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FMore
OL,12,Fsettled on Thursday with brighter
OL,13,Fskies and lighter winds. A spell of
OL,14,Fwet and very windy weather arrives
OL,15,Ffrom the southwest Friday, before
OL,16,Fturning more settled once again
OL,17,Fthereafter.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
